              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abantu ba Musengwa Katonda, mumusabenga abaghe amaadhi mu biseera byago bye gagwiramu. Musengwa Katonda oyo n'aleetera ebire okwekuluumulula, olwo yaagha abantu amaadhi, gaagwa mu nimiro dhaibwe dhaameramu ebisimbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
