              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 6:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abantu beebuuza ku misambwa, ni ku balaguzi, ni ku bavuunuzi b'ebirooto, aye bye babairamu bya buguya byereere era bizira kye bibayamba naire. Kale ekyo kyaleetera abantu okutambulatambula eyo batyo ng'oti ntaama edhibuze. Olwo baadaazibwadaazibwa olw'okubulwa omukulembeze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
