            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye akoba ati: “Nsungughaliire inho abakulembeze abo abafuga abantu bange, era ndidha kubabonereza. Nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye, mwene ndirabiriranga abantu bange Abayudaaya ng'oti n'omwayi bw'alabirira ebyayo bye. Era ndibaleetera okuba ng'oti n'embalaasi edh'omu lutalo edhitatya naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu abo n'omuliva abafuzi, n'abakulembeze, n'abaduumizi mu magye, abalifuga abantu bange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu b'omu Buyudaaya baliba ng'abalwani ab'omu lutalo ab'amaani, nga batyankirira abazigu baibwe mu bisoodo eby'omu nguudo. Balirwana baghangula n'abazigu baibwe ab'oku mbalaasi, kuba nze Musengwa Katonda ndi ghalala nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
